OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThere will
OL,6,Fbe a mixture of clear spells and a few
OL,7,Fshowers mainly in the west. Overnight
OL,8,Fsome more frequent showers spreading
OL,9,Fto Moray. A windy night.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FCloudy with showers or longer
OL,12,Fspells of rain, some heavy. Showers
OL,13,Fwill become less frequent later in the
OL,14,Fday. Windy at times.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FBright
OL,17,Fon Wednesday with some sunny spells
OL,18,Fdeveloping. Rain spreading from the
OL,19,Fwest on Thursday. Then brighter again
OL,20,Fon Friday with some sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
